  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p>This page lists all <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trees and bushes</a> available in the game and provides detailed information on each of them. To find general information on them, click to view the according page. Items are listed by level by default but the table is sortable.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Note:</b> Maximum price is found by selling 10 crops at <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shop</a> and divide the price by 10. If you sell at quantities other than 10, you need to ignore the decimal place.</li>\n<li><b>Note:</b> Data for boat crates has been compiled by players and may be erroneous. The table only lists the lowest and highest amount requested per crate. The exact number depends on <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level and the number of crates that must be filled.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Goods\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Type\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a>\n</th>\n<th>Max. price\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Time\n</th>\n<th>XP\n</th>\n<th>Per boat crate\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheat</a></b><br><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e2/Wheat.png/revision/latest?cb=20240218150024\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e2/Wheat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240218150024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3.6\n</td>\n<td>2 min\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>50-101\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/corn-2063\" title=\"Corn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Corn</a></b><br><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Corn.png/revision/latest?cb=20240218151631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Corn\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Corn.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240218151631\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>7.2\n</td>\n<td>5 min\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>50-101\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Soybean</a></b><br><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9e/Soybean.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219031547\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9e/Soybean.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240219031547\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a>\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>10.8\n</td>\n<td>20 min\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>24-47\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/sugarcane-2080\" title=\"Sugarcane\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blan